From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:29:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] windows.web: property map, transport info, cookies, filter
 credentials/certificate/errors, content streams, GetBuffer/GetInputStream
 (3211)

HttpRequestMessage.Properties (IMap<String,Object>) and TransportInformation; HttpCookie / HttpCookieManager
(Set-Cookie stored from responses, Cookie sent with requests); HttpBaseProtocolFilter ClientCertificate,
IgnorableServerCertificateErrors (IVector<ChainValidationResult> -> WinHTTP security flags), Proxy/ServerCredential
(answer 401/407 challenges), AllowAutoRedirect and UseProxy applied; HttpContent BufferAll/ReadAsBuffer/
ReadAsInputStream/WriteToStream; HttpClient GetBufferAsync/GetInputStreamAsync (GetStringAsync now completes
as IAsyncOperationWithProgress<String, HttpProgress>); GetIids/GetRuntimeClassName of the factories and JSON views.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

